@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title UC01 — Alternatif 1: Domain Email Tidak Valid
actor "Calon Pengguna" as User
boundary ":HalamanOtentikasi" as UIo
control ":AkunController" as AC
User -> UIo: kirimFormulirPendaftaran(nama, nim, email, kataSandi, setujuKebijakan)
UIo -> AC: daftarAkun(nama, nim, email, kataSandi, setujuKebijakan)
AC -> AC: validasiKelengkapanFormulir(nama, nim, email, kataSandi, setujuKebijakan)
AC -> AC: validasiDomainEmail(email)
note right of AC: Domain bukan @itb.ac.id,\npendaftaran dibatalkan (KF05)
AC --> UIo: false (domain tidak valid)
UIo -> UIo: tampilkanPesanGalat("Harap gunakan email berdomain @itb.ac.id")
@enduml
